Safety and helpfulness prompt structures were rendered into standalone JSON
with runtime placeholders retained and research extensions applied. The ToolEmu
simulator is not included. Other teacher and goal-evaluation templates originate
from the authors' research implementation.

The direction construction follows Contrastive Activation Addition (CAA).
